{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/403582-highlander-reboot-dave-bautista-is-the-kurgan","id":403582,"title":"Highlander Reboot Dave Bautista is the Kurgan","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-02-12T12:17:10-08:00","id":403582,"title":"Highlander Reboot Dave Bautista is the Kurgan","content":"Do I think Highlander should have a reboot? No, I believe the film is a classic for a reason. Then I am reminded that the Highlander: TV Series was great and a classic in its own right was a reboot of the franchise. Changing that the first movie with the Kurgan and Connor Fight was not the Quickening.<br /> <br /> So I am torn. I love Highlander and the TV series. The idea bothers me, but it is going to happen. So I might as well see how it goes. I could be disappointed or like it. Who knows?<br /> <br /> Well the Kurgan is evidently been cast in former WWE star turned actor Dave Bautista of recent Guardians of the Galaxy fame.<br /> <a href=\"http://www.blastr.com/2015-2-12/guardians-galaxys-dave-bautista-set-play-kurgan-highlander-reboot\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.blastr.com/2015-2-12/guar...hlander-reboot</a><br /> <br /> I have seen Bautista in 3 films each different and he is cast as the big henchman in the new Bond movie. Not bad for him.<br /> <br /> Since Ryan Reynolds is no longer playing Connor (thank the Gods, he choose Deadpool instead), I am hoping they cast a Scottish actor this time as Connor and not an American (or a Frenchman with a thick French Accent playing a Scotsman no offense Lambert).<br /> <br /> I personally think David Tennant of Doctor Who and Broadchurch fame I think would be perfect as Connor. He would be Scottish and he can pull this off IMO.<br /> <br /> As for Rameriz why not Sir Patrick Stewart...<br /> <br /> Probably my fan in me but I can see it working.<br /> <br /> Since we are stuck with a Reboot why not have fun and let's FAN CAST!!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4949,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4949-nene-richards","user":"Nene Richards","date":". 02-12-2015, 03:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4949-nene-richards","name":"Nene Richards","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4949_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-12T13:30:20-08:00","id":403643,"title":"","content":"I hated the original Highlander film. It was so terrible I didn't bother finishing it. I have been told that the series is better, but I don't have the courage to try it after how terrible the first movie was. So on that note, perhaps the new Highlander will be more to my tastes. And... I have no preferences in casting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-12T13:40:36-08:00","id":403647,"title":"","content":"Good for Bautista. I'm glad his film career is going well.<br /> <br /> There were only like four characters with any good sized roles in Highlander, though, right? Connor MacCleod, Juan S\u00e1nchez Villa-Lobos Ram\u00edrez, Connor's first girlfriend, his modern girlfriend and Kurgan.<br /> <br /> It would be nice if they got someone Egyptian to play Ramirez.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-12T18:14:51-08:00","id":403949,"title":"","content":"I feel like Bautista may be too good for this role, but we'll see what happens.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-12T22:57:40-08:00","id":404156,"title":"","content":"All opinions are in reservation until I see a teaser trailer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-13T01:45:05-08:00","id":404280,"title":"","content":"I think it works as a casting choice. I don't see the reboot actually happening at this point. It's been.... seven years since they started development. There isn't a big enough name on the creative side that's been attached to it so far that feels like they can push the project past the development hell of studio executives vs. directors with creative differences.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-13T16:46:57-08:00","id":405274,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>brjedi26</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/403582-highlander-reboot-dave-bautista-is-the-kurgan?p=403643#post403643\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hated the original Highlander film. It was so terrible I didn't bother finishing it. I have been told that the series is better, but I don't have the courage to try it after how terrible the first movie was. So on that note, perhaps the new Highlander will be more to my tastes. And... I have no preferences in casting.</div> </div> </div> </div>Awww...I always loved the original. Ah well, to each his own, right? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> As for a remake. Blah. I mean Bautista is good and all, but I wish we'd stop remaking every movie ever made...","signature":"<hr class=